    "detailed_description": "<strong>Fly frantically between fast-approaching obstacles by typing classic poems! Put your skills of both typing and timing to the test in this new spin on an old favorite! Prefer to fly casual? Try relaxed mode instead and take in the beauty of balladry!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/c05c8250ca7cb64d89d6f65622e5b629.avif?t=1726927130\" width=616 height=65 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/e2df82c97c3aadf88a2bf134eda974ce.poster.avif?t=1726927130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/e2df82c97c3aadf88a2bf134eda974ce.webm?t=1726927130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/e2df82c97c3aadf88a2bf134eda974ce.mp4?t=1726927130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Every letter you type causes the pigeon to fly! Can you last an entire poem without hitting any obstacles? With 5 poems of varying length and difficulty, there's plenty of aviating action to look forward to.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/17bbbca71a94cfb2cc0daf6cc8e5d982.avif?t=1726927130\" width=616 height=65 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/d3a0d9d9dcb05562cd65d3837c75e4a8.poster.avif?t=1726927130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/d3a0d9d9dcb05562cd65d3837c75e4a8.webm?t=1726927130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/d3a0d9d9dcb05562cd65d3837c75e4a8.mp4?t=1726927130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Looking for a more relaxed experience? Turn off obstacles and focus on enjoying the leisure of lyricism! Each level features a beautiful pixel art background based on the level's poem.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/doitbackwardsheading.png?t=1726927130\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/6ba9c8cea38d0110d0a541ce4dd5b52e.poster.avif?t=1726927130\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/6ba9c8cea38d0110d0a541ce4dd5b52e.webm?t=1726927130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942420/extras/6ba9c8cea38d0110d0a541ce4dd5b52e.mp4?t=1726927130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Too easy? Try doing it backwards! This challenge is only for the bravest of bards \u2014 have you got what it takes?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring the works of:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Emily Dickinson<br></li><li>Paul Laurence Dunbar<br></li><li>Lola Ridge<br></li><li>Oscar Wilde<br></li><li>Percy Bysshe Shelley</li></ul>",
